    {
      "id": "478f0a99-ae97-4c80-878d-184a371af992",
      "title": "Escute a mensagem e observe a informação nova que aparece no final.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "aa62875c-9a49-4b42-82ae-c97c5bd84fdc",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a apresentação fica um pouco mais completa.</p><p><strong>Hola, soy Elena. Soy de Chile y vivo en Bogotá.</strong></p><p>Em português: Oi, eu sou Elena. Sou do Chile e moro em Bogotá.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/33d9d42e230d41f3a08a44a135dae0b8_l04b04-hola-soy-elena-soy-de-chile-y-vivo-en-bogota.mp3?Expires=1794099402&Signature=zHH4bOKCcCSVw8Ze~0~49FvciLMt7Kr18AlL1Iae~ZLIPi2ae31RCnQHVmCAB0-4fQc9zgf29kDI8nG-5dmKpZHpLdBg2wXPSN2LhxtJrVYJeekRea2WgcjsOc77gce~YZrYjUKDLpVq7ASP3W414GWPj-Ppw6maVaBOVMYfccmSM3fyQVCeBciXTcaHLrexeDvaiErS6-AC6c26NnICzDIQbuodmJeqzKwMw~9Bcwxrno01ipfVSJ2dMlrIbtzCZdngXZ51vPUKBJ9bRVFGtsZM995byUrV3KoctW50qqIlGjKSkFN2YFCFPxR4cDc8bmr40ljBbcABQe1jczA5iw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
